// Capability examples, not a product roadmap -- deliberately no status field
// and no "Coming Soon" copy anywhere near this list (see section comment
// below). Order roughly follows the original 10-agent roster plus three new
// examples (lead qualification, internal automation, general custom
// workflows) that better communicate "we build to your spec" than another
// narrowly-named agent would.
